/// The kafka output type writes a batch of messages to Kafka brokers and waits for
/// acknowledgement before propagating it back to the input.
///
/// The config field `ack_replicas` determines whether we wait for acknowledgement from
/// all replicas or just a single broker.
///
/// Both the `key` and `topic` fields can be dynamically set using function interpolations
